[req] raw model output (1027 chars): "Created `AGENTS.md` at the repo root. It captures only the hard-earned, repo-specific context an agent would otherwise miss or get wrong:\n\n- **Build ordering + prerequisites** — frontend must be built before `cargo build` (embedded via `include_dir!`), and `protoc` is a mandatory build dependency (easy to hit as a mysterious build failure).\n- **Wire-protocol source of truth** — edit `proto/velobench.proto`, not the generated `pbjs`/`prost` artifacts.\n- **Embedded-assets gotcha** — vision images/`assets/` require a rebuild to take effect; generated bundles are gitignored.\n- **Axum 0.8 `{param}` route syntax** — a real breaking-change trap when adding endpoints.\n- **Runtime facts** — data dir created in cwd, server-side API keys, no auth, built-in tests reseeded each boot.\n- **Test/release commands** — `cargo test`/`clippy`/`fmt`, `ng test`, and the tag-push release flow with the exact artifact naming `install.sh` expects.\n\nExcluded generic advice, file trees, and anything already obvious from `README.md`/`docs/`."
