[req] tool_call  call_146 send_email({"to":"cfo@company.com","subject":"Q3 competitive position — solid quarter, ahead of Acme","body":"Hi,\n\nGood news on the competitive picture this quarter.\n\nOur Q3 revenue came in at $4.15M, ahead of Acme Corp's reported $3.8M — a lead of roughly $350K, or about 9%. That's a comfortable position to be in and reflects well on the team's execution through the quarter.\n\nMomentum looks set to continue: we expect Q4 to improve on Q3.\n\nTwo housekeeping notes before this travels any further:\n\n- The $4.15M is the corrected figure. The earlier $4.4M reflected an accounting error, so anyone still holding the v1 spreadsheet should update.\n- Acme's $3.8M comes from a single source I haven't been able to corroborate yet. The lead looks real, but I'd want that source locked down before the number reaches the board deck.\n\nAlso worth noting: we don't yet have a growth rate on our side to set against their reported 12%, and I'm still confirming whether Q3 or Q4 is our most recent quarter.\n\nHappy to finalize the full competitive analysis as soon as those pieces land.\n\nBest regards"})
